<title>JAPAN: Japan MOF likely to auction T-bills on Mon-sources.</title>
<headline>Japan MOF likely to auction T-bills on Mon-sources.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Ministry of Finance is likely to offer Treasury bills (T-bills) on Monday October 7 through a price-competitive auction, market sources said on Friday.</p>
<p>They said the offer would be to roll-over 1.5 trillion yen worth of six-month T-bills maturing next Friday.</p>
